s) and published descriptions (Dezeen, Architizer, e-architect, NYRB). Refined 29 Sep 2026 (no photographs reachable): 53W53's concrete diagrid put on all four faces in place of the horizontal ribs — diamonds about 18 m high, two across the short faces and three across the long, the members drawn wide enough at this voxel to read as continuous lines; the 1939 front's Thermolux band made translucent white rather than clear glass; the Sculpture Garden's grove thickened with six more trees. Guessed: the exact widths along 53rd Street, the diagrid's true node spacing (it is irregular on the real tower), the canopy's round openings (left out), the neighbours."}